    description: "Found in DEEP bakeoff deep-20260623-134237 cohort-001 iter-004 (SwiftyJSON). Two Swift structural gaps make the central type look hollow: (1) all 6 'subscript' nodes have ZERO contains edges and ZERO incoming edges — 'json[\"key\"]' / 'json[0]', the flagship SwiftyJSON API, is invisible in the graph; (2) members declared in 'extension JSON { ... }' blocks (rawData, rawString, operators — the whole public API) become flat 'function' nodes contained by the FILE, not by the JSON struct; only the two in-body methods (merge/merged) get correct 'JSON.' attribution. Related to WI-lojil (DONE — 'extract computed properties and subscript accessors as nodes'): the subscript nodes ARE now emitted, but they are edge-orphaned (a distinct connectivity facet beyond emission). Evidence: reflect/cohort-001/iter-004/SwiftyJSON.assessment.yaml."  # 5e6c
